# Keep source and configuration formatting deterministic on every runner.
# In particular, rustfmt.toml requires Unix newlines; Git for Windows otherwise
# checks text files out as CRLF before `cargo fmt --check` runs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Test fixtures are binary: parquet written by pyarrow, safetensors written by
# PyTorch. `text=auto` above would otherwise be free to inspect and (mis)convert
# them, and a corrupted fixture is a confusing failure rather than an obvious one.
*.parquet binary
*.safetensors binary
